# Linux 7.2 Baikal native-Ethernet development target.
# Exact 61-patch Baikal port plus unchanged 6.18 native PCI autoload/first-open
# patch, then the unchanged PR #3 HDMI underscan fix. Prior dev1 passed
# EXP-20261018-004; this new dev2 build has no hardware result.
# rebuilt/public artifacts have no hardware acceptance. See docs/PORT-7.2.md
# and provenance/7.2-ps4-baikal-native-dev.json.
TARGET_NAME="7.2-ps4-baikal-native-dev"
PLATFORM="ps4-baikal"
KERNEL_RELEASE="7.2.11-psx-ps4-baikal-native-dev2"
